  "body": "**[Original report](https://bitbucket.org/agriggio/art/issues/85) by Sebastien Guyader (Bitbucket: [Sebastien Guyader](https://bitbucket.org/Sebastien Guyader), ).**\n\n----------------------------------------\n\nAs reported in a recent discussion on [pixls.us](https://discuss.pixls.us/t/sometimes-1-pixel-artifacts-from-x-trans-demosaicing/18179), there’s a bug in xtrans white balance preprocessing. This bug also affects ART \\(tested yesterday with fresh build from source\\).\n\nA fix has been merged in RT dev branch: [https://github.com/Beep6581/RawTherapee/commit/d4fc4dc083b59165f5ae731099472406dc734105](https://github.com/Beep6581/RawTherapee/commit/d4fc4dc083b59165f5ae731099472406dc734105)\n",
